            "description": {
              "value": "You pummel a held foe, hoping to stagger them. Make a melee Strike against a creature you have grabbed. The weapon damage from this Strike is bludgeoning damage. If the Strike hits, the creature must attempt a Fortitude save against your class DC; this is an incapacitation effect.\n\nCritical Success: The creature is unaffected.\nSuccess: The creature is stunned 1.\nFailure: The creature is stunned 2.\nCritical Failure: The creature is stunned 3."
